  "body": "Positioned in the heart of sought-after Mission Bay, this brand-new residence at 1/36 Thatcher Street offers an exceptional combination of style, convenience, and low-maintenance modern living.\r\n\r\n* Final free-standing home available within the development\r\n* Generous 131 sqm floor area featuring 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms, including a master ensuite\r\n* Light-filled open-plan living flowing seamlessly to a private backyard\r\n* Freehold title with no body corporate or owners' association fees\r\n* Carport for the unit\r\n* CCC and title issued - move in immediately\r\n\r\nOpen homes as advertised.\r\nFor further information or a private viewing, contact Annie Fan today.",
